{"id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-subformula.md","title":"Modal Subformula Set","display":"df-modal-subformula — Modal Subformula Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-subformula","aliases":["89-df-modal-subformula"],"display":"df-modal-subformula — Modal Subformula Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-subformula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-subformula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-subformula — Modal Subformula Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\neg A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land B)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\land B\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\n\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\Box A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\ca