cerpt":"递归沿 [[89-df-modal-formula]] 的实际构造子进行；$\\to,\\lor,\\Diamond$\n等派生联结词须先展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}subformula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(p)&\\coloneqq\\{p\\},&\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\neg A)\n&\\coloneqq\\{\\neg A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A),&\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land B)\n&\\coloneqq\\{A\\land B\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\n\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\Box A)\n&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A),&\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\n&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{Prop}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\to,\\lor,\\Diamond","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1163,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]] — 模态子公式与出现变元集合"},{"id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}